menu "Geekhunger Advantage 360 layout"

config ADV360_SCOPED_TRACE
    bool "Explicitly armed, privacy-scoped RAM timing trace"
    default n
    depends on USB_DEVICE_STACK
    help
      Temporary diagnostic build only. No letters or raw HID reports are stored.
      USB serial START arms a maximum 60 second capture; DUMP stops and exports.

config ZMK_BEHAVIOR_ADV2_RESOLVER
    bool "Advantage 2 compatible key resolver"
    default y
    help
      Reproduces the modifier-aware tap/hold behavior of the original
      Advantage 2 QMK keymap on an Advantage 360 Pro.

config ZMK_BEHAVIOR_ADV360_BT_CONTROL
    bool "Sequential Advantage 360 Bluetooth control"
    default y
    depends on BT
    help
      Adds a timed Bluetooth control layer which passes ordinary input through,
      permits the NUM momentary layer, selects profiles 1-5, and clears the
      selected profile from either Delete or Backspace.

endmenu
